{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宇宙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事物"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬事萬物"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或稱常住真心，真如覺性，法　身，實相……等皆是真理之別名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即今稱主　觀主動等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即客觀被動等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東、南、西、北、東南、東北、西南、西北、上、下、即今稱空間。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "過去現在未來即今稱時間"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宇宙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "間萬事萬物"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此經幾無法不備，無機不攝　究佛學哲學者均不可不參究"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "客觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "星雲之說恐亦不及此說之詳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胞胎中受生之質"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此妙「有」妙「無」，與下說之，「無生之生」有生之生，其義頗奧，非語言文字可到，故為禪門要關。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿彌陀譯名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "季禧"}
